  "Steps 1 and 3 and 6 repeat the right-click with the pick; step 2 Escape cancels; steps 4 and 5 type a new title and press Enter; step 7 clicks Save with the prefilled title.",
  "result.requests is empty for the generic replay (crates/app/tests/replay.rs cannot answer a native menu pick); s002.rs checks afterEnter.requests and afterSave.requests, and the input's pixels from renameDialog.input."
 ],
